# Pre-Push Build Verification

- Before executing any `git push` or committing production code, ensure the build is tested locally and passes.
- Run `npm run verify` from the workspace root.
- Verify that backend TypeScript type checking and frontend Next.js production builds complete with 0 errors.
- Never push code that breaks local or production deployment builds.
